seg-c433f277c913 = SIB 2022-02R4, Recommendation(s): closing reminders on reporting

# text
seg-abef01b9b2a8 = Report events affecting safety under the occurrence-reporting regulation, and report suspected spoofing and higher-risk jamming to the manufacturer.

